 expósitos in templis cóli¬</l><l xml:id="m-2de97c27-9647-425f-8460-b6b0a14da76f" facs="#m-94965457-2b02-438a-8f83-a8eca91fe973" label="lyrics-like">U dona tuo sint digna conspéctu; mus, pia suffragátio conspiret. Per</l><l xml:id="m-12374154-3d44-4e72-aca5-942ddba7da66" facs="#m-0d8331d2-9fcf-4f95-9dfa-70368acec97e" label="lyrics-like">beáti Joánnis et Sanctórum, quos! Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-d0b5c767-b028-47db-913b-7d1db6faf961" facs="#m-2462664a-02f1-4dec-8eaa-e87772d5e804" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-6e54f60d-a14a-47d4-81e3-bad8d4edda20" facs="#m-852e176e-8822-435b-ac8f-c4840be324b3" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-3ad84516-846d-4952-aa64-380fe0d5f3ab" facs="#m-e0cec283-d33c-4c21-98f6-4ad243a01080" label="lyrics-like">Ráchi-a “pecca-tó- rum conte- rén- tur, con¬</l><l xml:id="m-820bba57-4f67-4922-bda0-192741ec6ea8" facs="#m-b88ded39-8e82-4b17-8eee-e8bc0e68604c" label="lyrics-like">fírmat au- tem jú- stos Dómi¬ nus.</l><l xml:id="m-a4d2c659-6a82-4f10-9510-d9e2e493201c" facs="#m-cbbd394e-b820-416c-9ff2-55fdd86ab5fb" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-abb6dc73-8fd6-4d2e-8be7-67aa1477dcca" facs="#m-54f99152-2d75-46b7-9a63-1e840c66e504" label="lyrics-like">YUmpta nos, quaésumus Dómine, frágio cumuláta, quorum imágines</l><l xml:id="m-a7273c7a-1613-479b-99d4-8259ad6027a3" facs="#m-a8ced68c-ef3f-45e7-9468-70eec2f4f0b6" label="lyrics-like">D dona caeléstibus armis tueán¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a943719-b99c-4e74-8e18-c4ebc9a964c6" facs="#m-daaee171-acfb-4640-9fba-cbdf8737c4f9" label="lyrics-like">evicit in Ecclésia esse venerándas.</l><l xml:id="m-c92d9f8e-05e4-4ba7-9962-904b54c28176" facs="#m-9a063278-93e9-4692-b160-6ff9629b1198" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-923efa2e-00f7-4aab-806e-25bd6d35cba0" facs="#m-9ef7cff9-149c-4cf4-8adc-1f71e7386c88" label="lyrics-like">tur: et beáti Joánnis patrocinia</l><l xml:id="m-1194d8cd-2a53-4503-b3f6-b1803ec6c2d1" facs="#m-eaed16d1-02a4-478a-979c-ad52e26b4b61" label="lyrics-like">circúmdent Sanctórum unánimi suf¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7fe354f-aae1-414d-8b5c-261c2c6a8eae" facs="#m-9a9d165e-af16-49bf-89ff-4d816819a023" label="ambiguous">St. John Capistran, Conf.</l><l xml:id="m-9e8e9c26-58f0-407f-becc-257cdba17cb4" facs="#m-3e7dff1c-c37a-4df3-b18b-b46982491b43" label="ambiguous">Semt-doubla</l><l xml:id="m-62ead33c-6473-4268-80b8-3f148f3ace69" facs="#m-11714333-740a-4569-873d-abe8bed3f2e6" label="ambiguous">28.</l><l xml:id="m-d487939f-2ea7-4351-b070-f6fdcb32eca6" facs="#m-60365853-01ec-4d76-a86f-12b057d339ce" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-e8a0b6c6-f0c1-4698-9a05-323910cd2f50" facs="#m-8d157fca-a6fb-4620-99c3-e99dc2837a8b" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui per beátum Joánnem ¡ sumus: ut spirituálium hóstium, ejus</l><l xml:id="m-e312f638-82ad-43d0-ad6d-71894e78c475" facs="#m-b90cfc7c-c92e-4d39-9012-beaa3afd83e1" label="lyrics-like">I fidéles tuos in virtúte sanctissi-intercessióne, superátis insidiis,</l><l xml:id="m-47a905d1-7563-4968-bf0c-1892418408c4" facs="#m-b61394f6-c09d-4470-98bd-3d0fdc4a34d0" label="lyrics-like">mi nóminis Jesu de crucis inimicis corónam justitiae a te accipere</l><l xml:id="m-5de253e7-e515-43cc-bbde-02f603e0cbe1" facs="#m-fba838f0-1f2a-4ec5-b5c3-e95c3f71837a" label="lyrics-like">triumpháre fecisti: t praesta, quaé¬mereámur. Per eúmdem Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-c66d66be-617a-4844-88db-128dc21246ff" facs="#m-3d58940f-929e-430d-92a7-7b42625500bf" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-82f6799f-ae8d-4b50-b055-831edcfe1b3c" facs="#m-8a1eccc2-14ef-47ea-a0eb-002c2d122c1a" label="lyrics-like">NAcrifícium, Dómine, quod im- rum insídias nos in tuae protectió¬</l><l xml:id="m-5bf0b241-3459-477c-b1b4-3eea3a14d134" facs="#m-ae46346e-3000-4b0e-becf-979b6d54015b" label="lyrics-like">nis securitáte constituat. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-78c3c570-4399-4ca0-ac80-51de879a8041" facs="#m-b9e8e612-32da-4f9c-9c06-e4343a95bc22" label="lyrics-like">Omolámus, placátus inténde: ut,</l><l xml:id="m-9a0515eb-4f5c-4ab8-babe-a9ddada45cdd" facs="#m-277f3dfc-2c4b-46be-9cc7-92e5638500e8" label="lyrics-like">intercedénte beáto Joánne Confes¬</l><l xml:id="m-531d868c-be05-4fec-8ec1-303a370adb41" facs="#m-9e7df3c4-06ca-452f-9567-491ebbc6ca34" label="ambiguous">minum.</l><l xml:id="m-dbba1939-49ba-480e-92d8-7d8dc218dc3f" facs="#m-5cde181f-aba3-45bd-b6ba-9043e13c5353" label="lyrics-like">sóre tuo, ad conteréndas inimicó¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
